      "Rationale": "The proposal combines physical activity with immersive VR mindfulness in a cancer-treatment population, which is a timely and potentially impactful integration of technologies. While elements (exercise, mindfulness, wearables, VR) are individually established, the combined, home-based intervention during chemotherapy could meaningfully improve engagement and has translational promise for survivorship care."
